SOLR-9029: fix rare ZkStateReader visibility race during
 collection state format update

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by a visibility race condition in the `ZkStateReader` class when updating the collection state format. Specifically, the logic did not properly handle scenarios where a collection reference was either unknown (new collection) or existed in a legacy state, leading to potential inconsistencies during state updates.

